Pie Family

[en.C12_DESC]
Starting from one day, bad weather began to appear more frequently than ever before, and Maud Pie could no longer contact her sister. It wasn’t until several months later, when Maud Pie returned to the rock farm after conducting geological surveys in remote areas, that she learned what had happened. Her parents were already old, so Maud Pie took over the management of family business, and tenaciously maintained the life and business of the Pie family on the rock farm as usual. Life on the rock farm is still monotonous, more difficult, but nothing has changed much. Maud Pie carefully preserved her sister’s room, and went to see it every day, fearing that she would suddenly return. But Maud Pie also knew that her sister was unlikely to return.
She found a small box under her sister’s bed while cleaning her sister’s room, and the box was labeled “For the best sister Maud Pie”. Opening the small box, it contained a variety of items that far exceeded the box’s capacity: fireworks, greeting cards, some drafts of unknown significance, and even balloons — inflated.
Maud Pie carefully examined the items in the box. These drafts were some toy prop designs — her sister’s designs were full of epoch-making and whimsical ideas. If the drafts of her sister were slightly modified, so that the cannons no longer fired confetti, but shells instead...
Soon, the new business of the rock farm began. Maud Pie was not sure whether this would ultimately bring prosperity or disaster to the Pie family, but she only hoped that her sister did not mind her unauthorized modification of the designs.

[en.PIHC_WS_C12_desc]
Except for that one pony who is different from the others, the Rock family — or the Pie family, does not have the skill of “outgoing” in its genealogy.
In the past so distant to be ever traced, the ancestor of the Pie Family, Holder Cobblestone Pie, crossed the entire Equestria to find a place to settle down. When he came to the land where the Pie family has lived for generations, he accepted the will of a stone. This is a four-meter-high egg-shaped boulder, standing alone and resolute in an ancient dragon’s nest, whose owner has long since disappeared. Holder Cobblestone Pie successfully cultivated a gravel farm, built houses and warehouses with dry grass and rocks, identified rare stones and mined for a living. Since then, the Pie family has thrived on this land, which is considered desolate by any other pony. To adapt to the harsh environment, from stone buildings to stone soup that can fill the stomach, the Pie family has used stones to the extreme. At the same time, the Pie family has cultivated a simple and frugal family rule, living a life like a monk. The monotonous mining work in the eyes of other ponies is their only entertainment activity, and the biting cold wind that ordinary ponies cannot bear is like a homecoming to them. No matter what the outside world is like, for decades or even hundreds of years, the Pie family only needs to do one thing: mining. Born, go to school, return to the family’s rock farm, mine, sell it, sleep, wake up and mine again, sell it... This is probably enough to summarize the lives of most Pie family members.
But all this came to a huge turning point. About a little more than twenty years ago, the heir of the Pie family, Igneous Rock, under the will of the marriage stone, privately married a mare named Mica, and now they have four children: the elder sister Maud Pie, the second sister Limestone Pie, and the younger sister Marble Pie, and that pink pony who changed the entire Pie family: Pinkamena Diane Pie, also known as Pinkie Pie. After a thunderous rainbow explosion, Pinkamena discovered her own uniqueness and expertise in partying, using her nickname Pinkie Pie and eventually becoming the representative and embodiment of the element of harmony and laughter. Although she is a complete outsider in the eyes of the Pie family, the other members still love each other deeply. Pinkie Pie unconsciously influences the entire family.
Among them, the most affected is the elder sister Maud Pie — of course, even after so many years, Maud Pie’s sense of humor has not improved. No, it’s not the sense of humor we are talking about, it’s contact with the outside world. The younger sister brought Maud Pie to make many friends, and even let her find her true love. The Pie family also fortunately discovered their blood relationship with the Apple family, making the long-standing cooperative relationship between the two parties even closer.
However, starting from one day, bad weather began to appear more frequently than ever before, and Maud Pie could no longer contact her sister. It wasn’t until several months later, when Maud Pie returned to the rock farm after conducting geological surveys in remote areas, that she learned what had happened. Her parents were already old, so Maud Pie took over the management of family business, and tenaciously maintained the life and business of the Pie family on the rock farm as usual. Life on the rock farm is still monotonous, more difficult, but nothing has changed much. Maud Pie carefully preserved her sister’s room, and went to see it every day, fearing that she would suddenly return. But Maud Pie also knew that her sister was unlikely to return.
A large number of hungry refugees fled from the north, and the Pie family took on a burden far beyond their ability, taking out all their belongings to entertain these miserable ponies as much as possible. Unconsciously, the Pie family of the rock farm found themselves to be the most popular on this land, and life on the rock farm is still monotonous, more difficult. But should this way of life be promoted to all the ponies on this land? Or should they watch them die in hunger and cold? Maud Pie hesitated a bit, and also felt what “struggle” was.
Finally, one day, she found a small box under her sister’s bed while cleaning her sister’s room, and the box was labeled “For the best sister, Maud Pie”. Opening the small box, it contained a variety of items that far exceeded the box’s capacity: fireworks, greeting cards, some drafts of unknown significance, and even balloons — inflated. Maud Pie raised an eyebrow slightly, her expression did not change much, as always, without saying a word. She stayed alone in the room for a long time, thinking of a friend that Pinkie Pie had mentioned many times, a pony who was as crazy and whimsical as her.
Maud Pie carefully examined the items in the box, and managed to contact Cheese Sandwich, and handed over the drafts of her sister that she could not understand. Cheese Sandwich and Sans Smirk realized that these drafts were some toy prop designs, and hoped to put them into production. But Maud Pie saw something else — her sister’s designs were full of epoch-making and whimsical ideas. If the drafts of her sister were slightly modified, so that the cannons no longer fired confetti, but shells instead...
Soon, the new business of the rock farm began. Maud Pie was not sure whether this would ultimately bring prosperity or disaster to the Pie family, but she only hoped that her sister did not mind her unauthorized modification of the designs.

